      "text": "ans = 0\n\nfor i = 0; i < N; i++\n    for j = i + 1; j < N; j++\n        if A[i] > A[j]:\n            ans++\n\nprint(ans) ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
